  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\nThis release expands OpenTelemetry support with W3C `tracestate` support and brings several fixes, notably automatic detection of the default Datadog Agent Unix socket.\r\n\r\n### Functional Change\r\n\r\n* Adds W3C `tracestate` support for OpenTelemetry sampling state. #354\r\n\r\n### Technical Change\r\n\r\n* Add 'Thread Safety' documentation. #361\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n* For Datadog Agent URL configuration, consider empty environment variables as unset. #353\r\n* Nest startup errors in telemetry product payload. #366\r\n* Automaticaly detect the default Datadog Agent Unix socket. #370\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-cpp/compare/v2.2.0...v2.3.0"
